# Walkthrough segment 8, from the Isthmus Village anchor (45 points).
#
# Boots and restores build/anchor_isthmus (slot 1): the village center,
# cherry bomb and buttercup already taken. The steps below are the same
# village-onward list as walkthrough_08_isthmus.xit.
#
# - Agree to rid the village of the censor-ship; receive the rusty key.
# - Take the Town Rock and both streetlight lamp covers.
# - Unlock and open the gate; north to the pier.
# - Take the sailcloth. Nada retrieves the rope and anchor.
# - Tie the rope to the anchor. Throw the hook at the log jam.
# - The headman planes the log into a board.
# - East, on the barren road: board then rock on the boulder.
# - Nada whacks the catapult; the rock traps the bucket in the meadow.

